---
const { detail = false } = Astro.props;
---
<section class="container tropic-spotlight" aria-labelledby="tropic-title"><div class="tropic-copy"><p class="eyebrow">LATEST GAME RELEASE / STRATEGIC SLOTH ORIGINAL</p><span class="status">Released · Android</span><h2 id="tropic-title">A little merge.<br>A whole island of delight.</h2><p>Tropic Tumble is our sticker merge game. Merge stickers, collect their shiny versions, and bring tropical scenes to life. Designed and built end to end by Remi Couture.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href={detail ? "#play" : "/tropic-tumble/"} data-track="product_click" data-track-product="tropic-tumble">{detail ? "Try the browser demo ↓" : "Discover Tropic Tumble ↗"}</a><a class="text-link" href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.strategicsloth.tropictumble" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-track="product_click" data-track-product="tropic-tumble-android">Get it on Google Play ↗</a></div><p class="tropic-publisher">Published by Strategic Sloth LLC.</p></div><a class="tropic-art" href="/tropic-tumble/" aria-label="Explore Tropic Tumble"><img class="tropic-logo" src="/media/tropic-tumble/logo.webp" alt="Tropic Tumble" width="900" height="442" loading="lazy"/><div class="tropic-phones"><img src="/media/tropic-tumble/shot-1-merge.webp" alt="Tropic Tumble sticker merge board" width="540" height="960" loading="lazy"/><img src="/media/tropic-tumble/shot-2-scene.webp" alt="Stickers placed in a tropical beach scene" width="540" height="960" loading="lazy"/></div></a></section>
<style>.tropic-spotlight{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:50px;align-items:center;margin-block:45px 65px;padding:40px;background:#edf2e5;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px}.tropic-copy h2{margin:22px 0;font-size:clamp(32px,3.4vw,48px)}.tropic-copy>p:not(.eyebrow){font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;max-width:520px}.tropic-copy .hero-actions{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px 22px}.tropic-copy .tropic-publisher{font-size:11px!important;margin-top:20px}.tropic-art{padding:24px;background:#def2ed;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden}.tropic-logo{width:230px;margin:0 auto 15px}.tropic-phones{display:flex;gap:16px;justify-content:center;align-items:center}.tropic-phones img{width:40%;border-radius:15px;box-shadow:0 12px 25px #16324f20}.tropic-phones img:nth-child(2){transform:translateY(12px)}@media(max-width:800px){.tropic-spotlight{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:30px;padding:25px}.tropic-art{max-width:550px;width:100%;justify-self:center}}</style>
